---
capri-skill: 1
id: towerdef
name: Tower defense
games: Bloons TD 6, BTD6, Kingdom Rush, Plants vs Zombies, Plants vs Zombies 2, Clash Royale, Bloons Tower Defense, Clash of Clans
---
In tower defense, early rounds are about economy and placing a few strong defenders where enemies pass the most (corners and long straight paths). Each turn: read the money, place or upgrade one tower, then press the fast-forward or start-round button. Prefer upgrading a good tower over adding many weak ones. Tap a tower to select it before upgrading. Do not spend premium currency. If a wave is lost, restart the level and place defenders earlier.
